  <data key="d8">downward__b00_r0004</data>
  <data key="d9">downward</data>
  <data key="d10">A quarantine-status group with high exposure yield per silent infectious person-step exerts greater transmission pressure on its members, raising the probability that an individual in that group shows a new exposure transition.</data>
